    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MMORPG DEV Tycoon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build the MMO of your dreams. Watch bots play it. Join them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MMORPG DEV Tycoon</strong> is a fantasy sandbox simulator where you become the developer of your own massive multiplayer online RPG world. Craft every detail - from the terrain and cities to the skills and loot - and watch as AI-driven bots &quot;play&quot; through your creation like real players. Want to join them? Jump in with your own character and experience your world firsthand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is not just worldbuilding. This is full-scale MMO development turned into a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196340/extras/b9837067891ace6bc29c6d7de65ad3a6.avif?t=1743944226\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Endless Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re not just placing trees or naming monsters. You're defining how abilities work, how quests chain together, how classes balance, and how the in-game economy flows. Every system is modular, tweakable, and deep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196340/extras/96bebca22cbbf60baedd07b2c0514389.avif?t=1743944226\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Terrain Sculpting &amp; Worldbuilding</strong> \u2013 Shape lands, build cities, place dungeons and natural wonders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc79 <strong>Custom Monsters</strong> \u2013 Design stats, behaviors, visuals, and drop tables.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Items &amp; Equipment Editor</strong> \u2013 From legendary swords to useless junk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddd9 <strong>Class &amp; Skill System Designer</strong> \u2013 Create classes, abilities, effects, and entire progression systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfd8\ufe0f <strong>Factions, PvP &amp; Wars</strong> \u2013 Shape alliances, rivalry, and open conflict.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Quest Creator</strong> \u2013 Main quests, side quests, branching stories, and dynamic events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Living Economy</strong> \u2013 Traders, auctions, player-driven supply and demand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddf5 <strong>Professions &amp; Crafting</strong> \u2013 Mining, gathering, crafting, fishing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc09 <strong>Raid Bosses &amp; Dungeons</strong> \u2013 Design deadly encounters with unique mechanics, phases, and epic loot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udff0 <strong>Sieges &amp; World Events</strong> \u2013 Unleash massive battles where factions clash.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddcd\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Play in Your Own World</strong> \u2013 Experience your creation as a player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf10 <strong>Share Worlds Online</strong> \u2013 Compete in leaderboards, showcase your creativity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Mod Support &amp; Dev Toolkit</strong> \u2013 Add your own models, icons, effects, animations, etc.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196340/extras/cf60e458978b631cc5f34259ebf27142.avif?t=1743944226\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're a game dev, a worldbuilder, or just someone who\u2019s always dreamed of making the perfect MMO\u2014<strong>MMORPG DEV Tycoon</strong> puts that power in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build. Watch. Play. Evolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196340/extras/af9b0fdfccd7715c10aa2e2d7c872f47.avif?t=1743944226\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add to your <strong>Wishlist now</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196340/extras/c6b20312b84b8ba93a574e110d2ca0dd.poster.avif?t=1743944226\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196340/extras/c6b20312b84b8ba93a574e110d2ca0dd.webm?t=1743944226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196340/extras/c6b20312b84b8ba93a574e110d2ca0dd.mp4?t=1743944226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And follow the Development on YouTube @Elindery</p>",
